<metadata><name>20HC Around Aquidneck Challenge</name><desc>From the 2026 Around Aquidneck Island Challenge SI (5.3 course marks, 4.2 bridge centre spans). Self-timed, 15 Apr - 31 Dec 2026, either direction; any course mark or bridge centre span may be the start/finish. RN16 to GC17 (Tiverton Basin) is untimed and engine is permitted. Official distance 32.0 NM. Drawn CCW from GC17 in the order of the SI log. R12A, R12, R6 East Passage and Sakonnet 3 and 6 are routing points only, not course marks. RN "2" is taken as Mount Hope Bay Approach Buoy 2 (LL#18135) - not yet user-confirmed. Sides are for the CCW direction as drawn, reading SI 4.1 "proper side" as the buoyage side (reds to port heading out the East Passage and east along the south shore, G1/GC11/GC17 to port and RN16 to starboard heading north up the Sakonnet); they flip when sailed clockwise.</desc></metadata>
